The technique of abstracting IP address with symbolic names is DNS (Domain Name Service)

Name servers assigned to the current system can be viewed by reading `/etc/resolv.conf`

Adding 'Name Servers' to /etc/resolv.conf

echo nameserver IP_Addr >> /etc/resolv.conf

Note: 
"""

A Domain name cna have mulitple IP address assigned.

ping domain_name get's one ip address among all of them

To get all the ip address assigned to a domain we use domain lookup utility (host,nslookup)

host google.com

nslookup google.com


"""

echo IP_ADDRESS symbolic_name >> /etc/hosts/ 

The above command is used to add a name to a ip_address
